Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:09:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Script=20Studio:=20option=20codes=20in=20logic,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20punching,=20custom=20code=20and=20theme=20=E2=80=94=20one=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?source=20of=20truth?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Conditions compare option CODES everywhere: the parser, the Studio store's
  write point and a one-time load repair canonicalise labels ("Yes", "__Yes__",
  "Option 1") to codes (Q3 = 1); unresolvable values are errors naming the codes.
  Multi-select "=" reads as selected. Prompts and survey context speak codes.
- Punching: add_punch / remove_punches copilot actions, SET on choice targets,
  hidden/calculated questions punched on every navigation step.
- Custom CSS/JS/HTML: def.ux items viewable and editable in Properties (question,
  option, page, block, survey scope) through validateUxItem; set_custom_html action.
- Theme: Branding gains background, appearance (option/radio/input styling,
  shadows, padding…), typography extras and tablet/phone overrides; set_theme
  copilot action gated field by field; Branding "Design with AI" (text or image,
  previewed, applied into the same branding); desktop/tablet/phone previews;
  the runtime puts the page theme on <html>.
- Tests: engine optionCodes/theme, studio copilot/intelligent, browser
  scripts/codes-sync-test.mjs (the 20-step regression); all mutation-checked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QAcfUsJLu3R4pYxzaj9SU4
